nd excluded from authority\n- independently source-resolves all 223 disagreements across exact 75/74/74 complete-paper shards and stages only `resolver_verified` rows\n- publishes deterministic reconstruction, exact state conservation, source/hash custody, false-accept/override audit, final topology validation, immutable-history/no-special-case evidence, and a 47-artifact manifest without downstream writes\n\n## Why\n\nBatch012 was the next frozen structural-upstream tranche under #1649. Before this change, its official QP/MS page-chain evidence, candidate-blind checker coverage, resolver decisions, and verified structural staging did not exist as a conserved, hash-bound authority.\n\nThe implementation follows the merged Batch011 pipeline and changes only Batch012 identity, frozen membership, dynamic counts, and bounded authenticated producer-layout adapters. Unknown or contaminated producer context fails closed; no semantic, KG, canonical, production, public, or downstream layer is written.\n\n## Terminal conservation\n\n`223 = 223 resolver_verified + 0 verified_agreement + 0 safe_rejection + 0 conflict + 0 unresolved`\n\n- verified structural staging: 223/223\n- primary checker coverage: 223/223\n- independent high-risk second reads: 169/169\n- false accepts / false overrides: 0 / 0\n- maker retries / repeated completed calls: 0 / 0\n- external or paid VLM calls: 0\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python -m scripts.vlm.issue_1684_finalize_resolution publish-final-evidence` (two byte-identical replay invocations)\n- `PYTHONPATH=. uv run --no-project --python 3.12 --with pymupdf==1.27.2 --with pillow==11.3.0 --with jsonschema python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1684_final_resolution.test.py` (8 passed)\n- `PYTHONPATH=. uv run --no-project --python 3.12 --with pymupdf==1.27.2 --with pillow==11.3.0 --with jsonschema python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1682_final_resolution.test.py` (8 passed)\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` (clean worktree; all substantive gates healthy, expected pre-push no-upstream warning only)\n\nCloses #1684\n","created_at":"2026-07-23T04:46:17Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T05:05:29Z","closed_at":"2026-07-23T05:05:29Z","merged_at":"2026-07-23T05:05:29Z","merge_commit_sha":"70b5db93624e7e845be84aa21e4af28e619e0b20","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1685/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1685/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1685/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/55bd28279080da701bbab2b5eb78e45534042393","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1684-9709-structural-batch-012","ref":"task/1684-9709-structural-batch-012","sha":"55bd28279080da701bbab2b5eb78e45534042393","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{